Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.43,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,搞快點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.65,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,門打不開  上鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:40.74,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.43,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥  快點過來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.95,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,門被鎖上打不開了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.85,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,救我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:52.21,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大樹？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.51,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,在你的書房裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:00.92,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.24,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,大樹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.26,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,他的心肺停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:20.00,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,必須馬上進行心肺復甦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:22.01,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,快點去叫救護車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:22.80,Ameku-text,,0,0,0,,是！
